# Files this repo owns. Template sync never overwrites these, and the
# withdrawn-file sweep never removes them — see template decision t-0052.
#
# The template already excludes README.md as of t-0052, so this entry is
# belt-and-braces: it keeps the product README safe independently of what the
# template's own policy does next. The 2026-09-25 sync is why that matters —
# it replaced this file's predecessor and then overwrote the README the
# predecessor protected.
README.md

# This repo's own release pipeline. The template does not ship a release.yml
# today, so nothing overwrites it — but it carries project-specific fixes (the
# npm >= 11.5.1 floor that OIDC trusted publishing needs, and the run-time
# provenance decision) that would be painful to lose silently if the template
# ever adds a file at this path.
.github/workflows/release.yml
